# Doco access credential shared by agents in this same local checkout.
# Before starting a new auth flow, agents should reuse this value if it
# works. Mint or rotate it via:
#   - `doco login` (localhost-loopback OAuth, shell-capable agents), or
#   - the MCP tool `doco_authenticate` (device flow, chat-only agents).
# Both write back here automatically for other agents in this checkout.
# Never commit this file once filled; other clones/machines keep their
# own local .env credentials.
DOCO_ACCESS=

# Optional. Refresh token returned alongside DOCO_ACCESS. Shared locally
# for future refresh-token rotation; still secret and never committed.
#DOCO_REFRESH=

# Optional. OAuth client identifier from /oauth/register. Reused across
# auth runs in this checkout so later agents skip registration.
#DOCO_CLIENT_ID=

# Optional. Override the Doco host. Defaults to https://doco.to.
#DOCO_HOST=https://doco.to

# Optional. Override the Doco handle. Defaults to the first URL found
# in .doco/connections.md, DOCO.md, or doco.md.
#DOCO_HANDLE=
